<workout_file>
    <author>Coach Claude</author>
    <name>Sweet Spot 3x10 — Reset Week</name>
    <description>Thu Aug 13, moved to AM after pool closure. SET FTP TO 185 before starting — that is the current working estimate, not a tested number.

3x10min at ~170W (165-175W band) with 5min easy between, then 10min Z2 and cooldown.

EAT FIRST. 40-60g carbs at least 25min before you start — the warmup doubles as digestion time. Riding sweet spot fasted at 6:30am is the exact pattern behind the low testosterone and free T3 on the Aug 11 panel. This is not optional today.

IGNORE HEART RATE. Observed HR has drifted ~20bpm since June and the cause is still unresolved (50k recovery failure, energy deficit, heat — all confounded). Hide the HR field if you can. Judge this session on WATTS and RPE only.

RPE ceiling 7/10. If holding 170W feels like RPE 8+, stop the intervals and spin easy — that is real information, not weakness. Morning power runs 3-5% below evening for most people, so do not over-read a hard-feeling first block.

TODAY IS NOT THE FTP TEST. Aug 19 (4x8min @ 180-190W) is. A compromised read this morning costs nothing.

You raced a 5k TT yesterday (17:38, load 183). This is a reset week. The point is to reintroduce bike quality, not to prove anything.

AFTER: 75-90g carb + 30-40g protein within 60min. Not at 10am.</description>
    <sportType>bike</sportType>
    <tags>
        <tag name="sweetspot"/>
        <tag name="703"/>
        <tag name="resetweek"/>
    </tags>
    <workout>
        <Warmup Duration="900" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.72" Cadence="90">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="75min: 15 warmup, 3x10min at 170W, 10min Z2, cooldown"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="30" message="Did you eat? 40-60g carbs should already be in. If not, sip a drink mix now"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="240" message="HIDE THE HR FIELD. Watts and RPE only today"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="540" message="3x30s spin-ups coming. Same power, 105rpm, relaxed shoulders"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="660" message="Spin-up 1: 30s at 105rpm"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="740" message="Spin-up 2: 30s at 105rpm"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="820" message="Spin-up 3: 30s at 105rpm, then settle"/>
        </Warmup>

        <SteadyState Duration="600" Power="0.92" Cadence="90">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="Block 1 of 3: 10min at 170W. Target RPE 6-7"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="180" message="Settle in. This should feel controlled, not urgent"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="300" message="Halfway. RPE check — 8 or above means stop after this block"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="540" message="Last minute. Smooth, no surge"/>
        </SteadyState>
        <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.60" Cadence="85">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="5min easy. Drink. First bike quality in a while — that felt how?"/>
        </SteadyState>

        <SteadyState Duration="600" Power="0.92" Cadence="90">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="Block 2 of 3. Back to 170W"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="300" message="Halfway. Same RPE as block 1, or higher?"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="540" message="1min left. Hold the watts"/>
        </SteadyState>
        <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.60" Cadence="85">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="5min easy. Take on some carbs if you have them"/>
        </SteadyState>

        <SteadyState Duration="600" Power="0.92" Cadence="90">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="Block 3 of 3. This is the one that tells us where FTP sits"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="300" message="Halfway. If 170W still reads 6-7/10, Aug 19 goes at 190-200W"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="540" message="Final minute. Done after this"/>
        </SteadyState>

        <SteadyState Duration="600" Power="0.72" Cadence="90">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="10min Z2 at 133W. Free aerobic volume, no cost"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="300" message="Get into aero if you are on the TT bike — position practice is free speed"/>
        </SteadyState>

        <Cooldown Duration="600" PowerLow="0.65" PowerHigh="0.45" Cadence="85">
            <textevent timeoffset="10" message="10min down. Note peak RPE on the blocks — that sets Aug 19"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="300" message="Post-ride: 75-90g carb + 30-40g protein within the hour. Not at 10am"/>
            <textevent timeoffset="540" message="Log the average watts you actually held, not the target"/>
        </Cooldown>
    </workout>
</workout_file>
